<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24166" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέω</span> A)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>binding together,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				418e
			</span></i>; <i>setting</i> of stones, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				45.11
			</span></i>; <i>tying in bundles,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				8.4.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδῶν δ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόδημα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ezek.
				<u>Exag.</u>
				97
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>complication of a dramatic plot,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύσις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1455b26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέσμη</span>
			 (prob. of a belt-purse), <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				121.9
			</span></i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεσμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
				Botan.,<i>joint,</i> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				2p.743D.
			</span></i></div>
